# RapidRoot — AI Incident Management System
# Complete End-to-End Build Plan + Unit Test Coverage

## Project Overview
RapidRoot is a Python-based AI incident management system with 4 pages:
- Page 1: Login
- Page 2: Overview Dashboard
- Page 3: Incidents Tab
- Page 4: Agent Inbox / Investigation Board

Backend: Python (FastAPI)
Frontend: HTML/CSS/JS (existing style) — frameworks allowed
Database: ChromaDB for RAG, SQLite for ticket/session storage
All pages share one state layer and sync in real time via WebSocket.

